# Rendered output. Each experiment keeps grid.mp4 (all camera views in one video) and the contact
# sheets, because the reports link to them; the separate per-view videos stay local (they are large
# and can be re-rendered with `python -m walkenv.render runs/<ID>`).
runs/**/videos/*.mp4
!runs/**/videos/grid.mp4
runs/**/preview/
runs/_smoke/
